From: Boris Rybalkin <ribalkin@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 20:45:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] webserver: set the request method for web page auth

lua_web builds a minimal ftl_conn without the method, so cross_site_request()
sees HTTP_UNKNOWN and treats every same-site or cross-site GET navigation as
a cross-site request. With no password set, opening the dashboard from another
host of the same site (e.g. after an SSO redirect) was answered with 403.
---
 src/webserver/lua_web.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

--- a/src/webserver/lua_web.c
+++ b/src/webserver/lua_web.c
@@ -80,7 +80,7 @@
 	}
 
 	// Build minimal api struct to check authentication
-	struct ftl_conn api = { 0 };
+	struct ftl_conn api = { .method = http_method(conn) };
 	api.conn = conn;
 	api.request = req_info;
 	api.now = double_time();
